    "name": "C.A.R.D.S Redux",
    "steam_appid": 3292890,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292890/extras/74a20951a15f55f6f0d4c1327509c009.avif?t=1746740310\" width=318 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>C.A.R.D.S REDUX is a roguelike game about a war on a fictional planet (that's almost identical to ours) where you play as robot protagonist, GLUNDO. A robot with the ability to retain memory throughout it's many deaths, in hopes that one day, they can mass produce it to help win the war.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292890/extras/31f044d067bc629ca0b4fd5adaf765fc.avif?t=1746740310\" width=205 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In C.A.R.D.S REDUX you can...</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy other Robots designed to stop you in your tracks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Cards as you advance throughout the rooms to prepare you as the difficulty scales.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go to Aubrey's Shop and purchase Chips, which you can allocate to one of three slots. These chips can modify how your run will go entirely!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy Bosses to prove yourself worthy as the BEST war machine this planet has ever faced.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get killed, like, a lot of times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock EVERYTHING!!! SECRETS!!! I would tell you what everything includes, but those would include secrets....</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292890/extras/74a20951a15f55f6f0d4c1327509c009.avif?t=1746740310\" width=318 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>C.A.R.D.S REDUX is a roguelike game about a war on a fictional planet (that's almost identical to ours) where you play as robot protagonist, GLUNDO. A robot with the ability to retain memory throughout it's many deaths, in hopes that one day, they can mass produce it to help win the war.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292890/extras/31f044d067bc629ca0b4fd5adaf765fc.avif?t=1746740310\" width=205 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In C.A.R.D.S REDUX you can...</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy other Robots designed to stop you in your tracks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Cards as you advance throughout the rooms to prepare you as the difficulty scales.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go to Aubrey's Shop and purchase Chips, which you can allocate to one of three slots. These chips can modify how your run will go entirely!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy Bosses to prove yourself worthy as the BEST war machine this planet has ever faced.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get killed, like, a lot of times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock EVERYTHING!!! SECRETS!!! I would tell you what everything includes, but those would include secrets....</p></li></ul>",
